## nupatch_bilinear.rib's own twin: the same four control points in the
## same order, the same frame, lighting and "plastic" surface, issued as
## a plain "Patch bilinear" instead of an order-2x2 NuPatch. The two
## images are compared pixel by pixel.
##
## A trailing Sphere follows AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section, "The
## desync convention."
Display "patch_bilinear_twin.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.2]
LightSource "distantlight" 2 "intensity" [0.8] "lightcolor" [1 1 1]
	"from" [2 2 -3] "to" [0 0 0]
Sides 2
Surface "plastic" "Ka" [0.2] "Kd" [0.7] "Ks" [0.6] "roughness" [0.08]
	"specularcolor" [1 1 1]
Patch "bilinear" "P" [-0.5 -0.5 0   0.5 -0.4 0.2   -0.4 0.5 -0.1   0.5 0.5 0.3]
AttributeBegin
	Translate 1.5 0 0
	Sphere 0.3 -0.3 0.3 360
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
